guide polestar-completionist-alliance/class-warlock
title Warlock class quests (10-60) (Completionist)
faction Alliance
class Warlock
levels 10-60
category Class
zone Durotar
why Every Warlock class quest from level 10 on, in level order. The earlier ones are in the starting zone guides.
reward text What the Warlock quests give, quest by quest: abilities, forms, pets, totems or gear.
